'''''Goniophlebium''''' is a [[genus]] of [[fern]]s in the family [[Polypodiaceae]], subfamily [[Microsoroideae]], according to the [[Pteridophyte Phylogeny Group]] classification of 2016 (PPG&nbsp;I).<ref name=PPGI/>

==Taxonomy==
